// The gateway's models, as they are actually configured (2026-11-11). Applying it changes
// nothing on the current gateway; use it to restore the models after experiments.
// Run from openclaw-gateway-docker:
//   docker compose exec -T openclaw-gateway node dist/index.js config patch --stdin --dry-run < ../openclaw-express/openclaw-model-pin.json5
//   docker compose exec -T openclaw-gateway node dist/index.js config patch --stdin < ../openclaw-express/openclaw-model-pin.json5
//
// - Primary: Groq gpt-oss-120b. Llama 3.3 was retired from Groq.
// - Fallback: gpt-oss:20b in Ollama on this Mac (`ollama pull gpt-oss:20b`; the Ollama app
//   must be running). The container reaches it at host.docker.internal:11434, the native
//   Ollama API (no /v1). "ollama-local" is OpenClaw's marker for a keyless local host, not a secret.
// - When fallback kicks in: a Groq 429 is first retried on Groq (up to 10 attempts), unless
//   Groq asks to wait longer than 60 s or the daily limit (TPD) is used up; then the gateway
//   answers with Ollama at once. While Groq is in cooldown (30 s, 1 min, then 5 min),
//   new replies go to Ollama.
// - Ollama: contextTokens 16384 (also sent as num_ctx) holds the ~2,900-token prompt plus
//   20 history messages; keep_alive 30m keeps the 13 GB model loaded between replies;
//   timeoutSeconds 300 covers a cold load.
// - gpt-oss is a reasoning model. `npm run whatsapp:sync` sets
//   agents.defaults.thinkingDefault = "low" to keep its hidden reasoning short (both models),
//   and src/utils/sanitizeChatAnswer.js strips reasoning that leaks into Express answers.
// - Groq free tier: 8,000 tokens per minute and 200,000 per day for gpt-oss-120b (per Groq
//   organization). One reply costs ~2,900 input tokens; see CLAUDE.md "Token budget".

{
  models: {
    providers: {
      ollama: {
        baseUrl: "http://host.docker.internal:11434",
        api: "ollama",
        apiKey: "ollama-local",
        timeoutSeconds: 300,
        models: [
          {
            id: "gpt-oss:20b",
            name: "gpt-oss:20b",
            reasoning: true,
            contextWindow: 131072,
            contextTokens: 16384,
            params: { keep_alive: "30m" },
          },
        ],
      },
    },
  },
  agents: {
    defaults: {
      models: {
        "groq/openai/gpt-oss-120b": {},
        "ollama/gpt-oss:20b": {},
      },
      model: {
        primary: "groq/openai/gpt-oss-120b",
        fallbacks: ["ollama/gpt-oss:20b"],
      },
    },
  },
}
